  <p id="c-liangshu-029-xiaoji-wangtai:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南康簡王<persName id="c-liangshu-029-xiaoji-wangtai:p001:m0004" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_C">績</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-029-xiaoji-wangtai:p001:m0006" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_C">世謹</persName>，高祖第四子。天監八年，封南康郡王，邑二千戶。出爲輕車將軍，領石頭戍軍事。十年，遷使持節、都督南徐州諸軍事、南徐州刺史，進號仁威將軍。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-029-xiaoji-wangtai:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">十六年，徵爲宣毅將軍、領石頭戍軍事。</p>
</text>
